// TrackerAttention One thing wrong with a tracker right now, worked out when it is read. `unrecorded` — an occurrence whose time has passed with nothing logged or skipped, for forty-eight hours after that time, whether or not it alerts anyone (`entry_id`, `occurrence_at`). `out_of_range` — a number field whose latest logged reading is outside its range (`entry_id`, `field_id`, `value`, `range`). `gap` — longer than `gap_hours` since the last entry, the tracker's creation, or its last resume, whichever is latest (`since`, `gap_hours`).
